			24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 16, 18, § 49</span></i>; called
			also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sugdĭāni</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 2,
			5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 5,
		6</span></i>.</div>
